    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Shirin",
        "Parvezravan",
        "Kisra",
        "Shiruyeh",
        "Khorramdin",
        "brass mask"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: Shirin, Parvezravan and Shiruyeh",
      "content": "Shirin was Liloupar and Ormazd's half-Jinni daughter, born under three prophecies Liloupar spoke over her. Parvezravan, born Kisra and Liloupar's secret son, was adopted by Ormazd, married Shirin and became the 'hero' king after the night Ormazd and his 300 children died. Their son Shiruyeh was exiled behind a brass mask and later killed his father. The city fell with him. Liloupar admits she used her children's hands and hearts to carry out her revenge.",
