    "4": {
      "uid": 4,
      "key": [
        "Ferigees",
        "my sister",
        "Eternal Oasis guardian"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: Ferigees",
      "content": "Ferigees, a Jinni who also served Nabu Malikata, is the one Liloupar calls 'my sister' (the Chinese term need not mean blood kinship). She realised Liloupar's schemes would doom Gurabad and bound her spirit into a machine on Deshret's Glass Goblet to guard the Orchard of Pairidaeza. She called Liloupar a traitor and refused to let her pass.",
