      "key": [
        "Jeht",
        "Tanit",
        "Azariq",
        "Aderfi"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: Jeht and the Tanit",
      "content": "Jeht is the young Tanit woman who opened Liloupar's seal with the Traveler's help, hoping to bury her parents' remains in the Eternal Oasis. She resented Liloupar taking the Traveler as master. Liloupar calls her 'little wildcat' and 'my dear girl', and in 6.6 tells her she has grown and does not rage at the truth.",
