      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: Babel and the Eremites",
      "content": "The Tanit Matriarch Babel asked Liloupar to lead the way to the Eternal Oasis. Liloupar asked her to dance and entertain them, mocking her servility,, then agreed only because the Traveler wished it. She holds the Eremites in low regard for their attempts to use her.",
