    "7": {
      "uid": 7,
      "key": [
        "Collei",
        "Nicole",
        "god remains",
        "Windrise wish"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: Collei, Nicole and the Windrise wish",
      "content": "At Windrise, beneath the great oak, Liloupar asked Collei to let her take the remnants of the Goddess of Flowers from her body. She offered to make Collei an ordinary human in return. Collei agreed, Liloupar absorbed the remains and her bottle's light went out. Collei felt no different afterward, since she had already received what she longed for.",
