    "8": {
      "uid": 8,
      "key": [
        "Gurabad",
        "City of Kings",
        "Gurabad's Ruin",
        "Murals of Gurabad"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: Gurabad",
      "content": "Gurabad was the ancient 'City of Kings' where Ormazd, Parvezravan and Shiruyeh ruled; the city fell into a chasm filled with Abyssal power. Liloupar returned there in Memories of Gurabad (3.4) to face it. In 6.6 the Fatui disturbed its sealed Jinn, and she awoke to calm them.",
