    "9": {
      "uid": 9,
      "key": [
        "magic bottle",
        "true name",
        "Jinni contract",
        "Jinni in the Magic Bottle"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: The magic bottle and true-name contract",
      "content": "Jinn bind themselves to humans by giving them a true name, which lets the holder command them; the Jinn are said to hate humankind in the legends, though Liloupar says one does not hate vermin. She chose the Traveler as master and warned that only death can break the contract. In gameplay she became a gadget in Sumeru's desert.",
