        "Seven Pillars",
        "Thoth",
        "Heryshaf",
        "Sobek"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: Seven Pillars of Deshret",
      "content": "In 6.6 Liloupar met Thoth, Heryshaf and Sobek imprisoned in Aaru and laughed at them, mocking their airs. Thoth asked how King Deshret's seal had let her go; she told him to ask her master one day. In Darkness Looming she called the Seven Pillars underwhelming and unworthy of her attention.",
