      "key": [
        "Tale of Shiruyeh and Shirin",
        "Brass Mask Rebellion"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Liloupar: The Tale of Shiruyeh and Shirin (unreliable account)",
      "content": "A Jinni's story in two books found in Sumeru which gives Liloufar's name but omits her scheming, blaming the banquet deaths on slaves and a resentful Shirin. In-world it is an entertainment 'of unknown origin and full of absurdities'. Treat it as legend, not as Liloupar's own account.",
